#: scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 306153f66a5f94f4198fb80ca46caa181b6306c3066171bb74623ca2933f766d
#. default-sha256: b3744297d1b747a484b663c3d60e5bb4ca133314fed051e10589d0cbe8208591
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4AF3C7D2_339F_448B_B256_1268AAE11D3D"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫As you "
"know, I am not from this land."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫알다시피 나"
"는 이국 인간이다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 80773418fd2f46e20f63e8168d242ff1b04c414b519267802f2030286ead19e6
#. default-sha256: d1701133e21db364f20584a9629ef8b7a2dd5ba260bbde71a0aafe5dce6e6331
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F654B6ED_85D3_4495_9C45_7DB4B48E14FC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫The issue is,"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫하지만……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fb1bff33c4cc0bbafc02cd947829af89ff7ba5890f7f5f27309a2434fcf0bc89
#. default-sha256: a5f0a92fd28325a079b5782940087cd208e20c5389d94746dc83cda0eec92e5f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_7CA8498D_9531_4EE3_B774_EF2F2164929C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫I don’t know any more about where I came from than you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫나는 내가 누구인지 잘 모른다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4c3c146c035417333f69acc6de07293bb7f49bb38b705b89b49f806a1d015e9b
#. default-sha256: 1c628ee1879c64b6f96b2cb8aa321aa558e8af3cf4c35654a0e09b1c334baf8a
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_62E45312_CA49_40BA_A281_F36395ADB333"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫most of my memories are gone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫기억이 결여되어 있다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 18fbc1adc93d0ccd0552fa78d95c560d612b519f5d794e236973c4c8387d1b18
#. default-sha256: 3fa029ef5e85155d34c8ec210c1f4bbc37cf39c052bad2b8431b92284b4c4938
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_46ABE5C8_45D1_4BD6_B048_61D189617F6A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫or perhaps a messenger."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫타국의 사자였을 거다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 5e1fe8f9e1f20801a1f4e3c873d1695831b889fd01734780471d5fba8850dffc
#. default-sha256: e1a51bd67484f6c3b944fd655402d9fe06faaaf4a4416985a4ae7d3f97e2ad86
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_EB475B59_2055_49A4_8FC2_25857E677057"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I vaguely remember being waylaid.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫We were vastly outnumbered, massacred with little "
"resistance.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Or at least, I assume that’s what happened."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫누군가에게 습격당한 기억이 있거든. ⟪k:1⟫우리는 물량에 밀려서 ⟪k:2⟫어쩔 도리도 없이 괴멸당했"
"다. ⟪k:3⟫……아마도 ⟪k:4⟫말이지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 746df22f12f3569c27bff2350d91e02812680fa61edc85603f690afb4c29db5b
#. default-sha256: ad68537fd6098935ae233012522de74a916d63bedfcbb6d48d03786699e66a27
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_91A0BF4C_661D_4FD5_92CC_7791798CE7F3"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was a slave for one grueling, torturous year.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No one treated me like a human "
"being.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫There was no one from the same part of the world as me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫노예로 지낸 1년은 굴욕적이었으며……, ⟪k:1⟫사람다운 대우는 당연히 못 받았다. ⟪k:2⟫동향으로 보이"
"는 사람도 없었고――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2753f931c175a02ed096b3509b03cc5b9ada751404f626cf96a584204c76ac76
#. default-sha256: b752db504bf9a82cd5b57c4fbf842b86b55dd3dab66087e455de57b5cf3fdadb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D0CD0533_F04D_43F6_BA35_FF5B6565F2CC"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫And there was no one to come to my aid."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나를 구하러 오는 자도 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 979819582fd1413e05e0743fed7a380d438e2207cb04ee4fb1ad3f113f6772a4
#. default-sha256: ee4f9c36b79946f084b55866f3e9db2494645652ba3ea288ac1e9d8f6d268d34
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B49E446F_A5CA_4682_9308_20113A8DA388"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But to be honest, I think I was happier ⟪k:1⟫not⟪k:2⟫ understanding what people were saying "
"about me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하지만…… ⟪k:1⟫무슨 말을 하는지 모르는 게 ⟪k:2⟫차라리 나았을 수도 있다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4e3f950208a9eeb1ad4bd69defb6e530480ae3d0e36332de1db7b5047eb36107
#. default-sha256: 1c4f39d779f1f916fe2002253625273a05ab5bc80b13feaa3adbef100cb22060
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5C79E8CC_1756_4827_82A1_033BDCF716E7"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And the longer I was treated as something less than human,⟪k:1⟫the more I began to question "
"whether I really ⟪k:2⟫was⟪k:3⟫ one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사람만도 못 한 대우를 받다 보니, ⟪k:1⟫내가 점점 ⟪k:2⟫진짜로 사람이 아닌 것 같아지더군."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 1c14753c2681d28f5304273bb6c4b87a615a4b83dd741ce8183df655118cd560
#. default-sha256: 2bcf988d1d9fcdc6f16c7a1a39d1c6d0506dc2c6334851cbf87c4f9f87250e9f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5D4E2E70_2BA6_4308_8F92_A45288D8602A"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It was packed front to back with slaves—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫or soon-to-be slaves, I suppose I "
"should say."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫다른 도시로 끌려가는 중이라 ⟪k:1⟫마차 안에는 다른 노예가 많이 있었다. ⟪k:2⟫또한 노예가 될 신"
"세에 놓인 자도…… 있었나."

#: scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bb9cfbbe61a6f11a3677f9fa84e416f3765fc9466456e7a761baa230cbcb76bc
#. default-sha256: fd01134067f413f94db4d6b5f3312e3fb1589288884c5333274d05c6d9f52e68
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_5598B724_4321_4338_A2FA_062604A78166"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But beyond that, I didn’t think much of it.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I didn’t find it disturbing or "
"unpleasant..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫하지만 ⟪k:1⟫그 점에 별 생각은 안 들었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫괜스레 꺼림칙해하거나 ⟪k:4⟫혐오감을 품진 않"
"았지……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3fc13c9c5d2834ae6b2b1ba509ef19a5fd8615a24b12fb55b9d9d33496a182d6
#. default-sha256: 6c1468432a0ade37a1d1a89c436110273694a7abb51c9665930f087c362ea14e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_B22846FD_AE3C_4CE5_B1E7_CBF181370F41"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫At my question, the girl turned her head up to look at me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Surprise crossed her "
"face for a few brief seconds,⟪k:3⟫but that was her only reaction to my appearance."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫내 질문에 ⟪k:1⟫소녀는 고개를 들었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 얼굴을 보고 조금 놀란 눈치였지만, ⟪k:4⟫소녀"
"도 그게 다였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b018673ce8a1112234f90c210176d8764428d3bf3da2171260e6c43dcc2989f1
#. default-sha256: ba2e368f52da670efe2c3c80123ebc1f7aed122d137a3e90a08e4e8f2e8e96ad
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_90FE4610_3F11_4A96_8E4F_A3D7F00D11B6"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I assume her thought process was roughly the same as mine, so she felt no need to fear me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나와 똑같은 생각을 했을 거다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫특히 겁먹을 필요성도 없던 거지."

#: scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b9ffabf68ec36b6774c841b744397c7f0050e61c8d73ff6f17a5f23330dbcc2c
#. default-sha256: e41b784043fb1e62bac7e73aeed233ec9b31405be26061d62262aa5483c798a4
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_85A2FDBC_1AFC_48DF_AC4C_7707E3DE1EB4"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’m sad because I didn’t get the chance to show my gratitude to people very dear to me."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫소중한 사람들에게 ⟪k:1⟫감사를 못 전한 게 슬퍼요."

#: scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf3704371d1f6f47811170a3043f06930144add529c3a033371ba2aa32155733
#. default-sha256: e68c6d803120cf2643e0fd534000360198b1b5366c37292856990621d142c3eb
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_587E1576_703A_451D_82BC_2C5A4C09DD62"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫her voice, despite being soft, cut through the crying and wailing of the other slaves."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫작은 목소리였는데도 ⟪k:1⟫다른 노예들의 오열과 울음소리에 묻히지 않고, ⟪k:2⟫내 귀에 깔끔하게 "
"닿았거든."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: fd7a3719d4c6c0ff43ecec12e8ee557b3c68b2eba14ecf7e64baf4fc1dee04f8
#. default-sha256: 1471b7c0dcdd45382e3795ca3ee0b86b661075847b10d4d00dcc6acdfde5ec03
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A555FD47_344D_49EA_8C98_1E6339700658"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I pictured it like... ⟪k:1⟫a single patch of clear water in the middle of a swamp,"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 순간…… 내 안에 맑은 물 같은 이미지가 남았다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫탁한 늪 한 곳에만 ⟪k:3⟫투명한 물이 "
"있어서――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 24b7ce3faaccb274c956e0b43699846fc479b98fe7de39f0a1eb40ae2ee9b6ba
#. default-sha256: 3d3be57fe643cf9d4b0895da080bb141d5bc9760680bc018fa75fcd964945f5b
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1523D91D_0AAD_47FB_85DC_F5D0923DFD5B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I’ll apologize... ⟪k:1⟫anything!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫사죄를 원하면…… ⟪k:1⟫얼마든지 하마……!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e4f9f9acb08a5da4c4cbe551ba1213d134ecdd0d3095e9bfb1c201da91f9fc4e
#. default-sha256: 31b54adc12e8b28c98d65600e59c1d439b16301d3d9228e49b6b12fab27675af
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D8E48D86_DFF4_4599_8060_1E6E498FA011"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫............"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫…………."

#: scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: dbd1355d0964a5faeabf3e9a2b17e430b62e1865b559932fc8cdf3c64210bd78
#. default-sha256: ec6c1b4f7c841c581ef9a4a3990ac1d24c36c198fe8572516ffd18ae7df3f725
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_089B583B_F350_4F78_9032_45D919E1EB2B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Ahahahahahahaha!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫하하하하하하하………!!"

#: scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0d3c4c732da2ce9d27eca6d30548968c9a491989aba38799c66da2f589aea155
#. default-sha256: 2c92ca22a7cde64845702587a866f427194cdf850e5992f57bab0f10a6a4c65f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_4383889C_5F68_4126_A404_75D6368BC473"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Holding a sword in my hand felt amazingly... ⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫right⟪k:8⟫."
"⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Whatever work I once did must have required me to use a blade."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫검을 잡으니 ⟪k:6⟫나도 놀랄 만큼 손에 익더군.⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫나는 원래 검"
"을 쓰는 일을 했던 걸 수도 있다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6032f41df227f7d65c8f52882e6ba78b4e8eb01eb2f2ddd7b02ddd1e1feb7af5
#. default-sha256: d767a70514571a468e9e722df204214f2a659de31cda71d0ffd78108092d8491
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_89902CC0_AFC6_42A0_A5A4_BBC64B3B4FC1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Dead bodies sprawled out around me.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Corpses I had made. Lives I had snuffed out."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 주위에는 시체가 나뒹굴었다. ⟪k:1⟫내가 만든 시체지.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫내 힘이…… 그런 거였다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3ee7384f3132d4b222f8146fd995a2cdae9d115e215a6a438fa21de561614475
#. default-sha256: c65c39103d2d7341f7e10132833fec966889c56f3d2e69a737aabf8ec2867256
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_0A0C1F49_22F0_451C_B592_62052AAB7555"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t have the words to describe the high it gave me killing those men, the power I felt "
"over them."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그때 느낀 고양감은…… ⟪k:1⟫이루 말로 못 할 만큼…… 기분 좋았다. ⟪k:2⟫나는 내 힘에 취했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aebff7f6a6a3eb30d9285d76cdb33f483e2ab6a5b36eb7b857fdf3a721795cae
#. default-sha256: df67ac8d2fa15c6feb7c2ea70bb0a9d2364f591c69db27195d2f518e529b9f84
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_ECE749DB_420F_4DC2_AB04_C067F0CDB9CE"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I was driven mad by the stench of blood filling the air.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫No, it just drew out what "
"was always there."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫독한 피냄새가…… 나를 미치게 했지…….⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫아니, ⟪k:3⟫나는 처음부터 미친 거였다."

