msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_FAD5924A_7933_43A1_897A_E295CF291CDD"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I went into a frenzy, slaughtering the helpless slaves I had never intended to kill."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫죽일 생각이 없던 노예들을, ⟪k:1⟫저항도 못 하는 자들을 차례차례 죽이며……"

#: scenario8:scenario8_E2EB80CB_8E92_444E_A938_1C1BA6CF706F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a2a2d856b95c5222790c9b32d696bb250a5798f265e8b0194d47e9f8d0d9cca9
#. default-sha256: 435672e1d691fb69b10a4fbd84f4b3da568f55e43561cbd9fb76ad99be0fd82f
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_E2EB80CB_8E92_444E_A938_1C1BA6CF706F"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t get enough. ⟪k:1⟫I reveled in it."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫끝내줬다. ⟪k:1⟫끝내주게…… 유쾌했다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫이 세상에 이만한 유열이 있단 걸――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_9D8B1D15_7075_46C2_A8C8_7853458D5C1B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: ca37c0e9dacbd76e7a332cce27cbc1bbaf739ad2291bfadfcb762b9a5ddd6ce9
#. default-sha256: ce4d78d8f575f94d84e15aca38afd7edafbe74f624645fa51291ba4a83fc1ed0
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_9D8B1D15_7075_46C2_A8C8_7853458D5C1B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The look of fear in their eyes.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫The way their faces twisted.⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫The splatters "
"of blood around their mouths, open in screams."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나를 보는 겁먹은 눈빛과――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫공포로 뒤틀린 입술……, ⟪k:3⟫절규하는 피투성이 입……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_F1670F3D_3BA8_490C_96B1_E60F3A2B2B89
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 45884d8b97f78389199f6017ee1f5087b367977f97d7074a49fb986366c154f8
#. default-sha256: 4cc0fb33f11cc32242759210bd4f4e0894dfbccee453be8d42f1e4d6f1766849
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_F1670F3D_3BA8_490C_96B1_E60F3A2B2B89"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Heads went rolling off shoulders, hot geysers of blood spewing from open necks."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫피보라로 그치는 수준이 아니었다……. ⟪k:1⟫목이 날아간 몸에선 ⟪k:2⟫열띤 피가 분수처럼 분출되었"
"다……."

#: scenario8:scenario8_8A6725FA_ED3A_4AB9_B00A_A3D3D530FFC2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2125413895a992385e2874f2464007f04dacf153d56dff4972fa222555786d89
#. default-sha256: d57a016a0d15898befccd08fdbfd16d9cf033cc0e941f19292daccd1963b4a89
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_8A6725FA_ED3A_4AB9_B00A_A3D3D530FFC2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I don’t know if I was unconsciously avoiding her or if it was just a coincidence, ⟪k:1⟫but "
"the girl was the only one left alive."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫무의식적으로 피하던 건진 몰라도――⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫남은 건 ⟪k:3⟫그 소녀 뿐이었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_30A39052_C8A3_4A9B_8C97_41A807382651
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 82ce5ba1915e00b6d65f2b7413bde57c7dafced1b2839e09096e3f046c08958d
#. default-sha256: c097ba0413521bcd6e49b9301a5a6307f685250304ffd8096d8be1d622f4aa14
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_30A39052_C8A3_4A9B_8C97_41A807382651"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She, of course, hadn’t been spared the mess, so she sat there, drenched in sticky, red gore. "
"⟪k:1⟫Her lips appeared to be trembling, though I couldn’t tell for sure with so much of her skin "
"missing."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫물론 ⟪k:1⟫소녀의 몸도 튄 피를 쬐었다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫문드러진 얼굴이라 표정을 헤아리기 힘들었지만, "
"⟪k:4⟫입술이 떨렸다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_6D16CFAD_FBF5_45FA_9C7A_78453CA1C505
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 17c84ba84b43e37d24b21526736c6a80989174c3023500e14ff3f89a42d429ad
#. default-sha256: b7879615d39ddbedd787db7ef493642da73f41c42dde87fd9a6759f9c3ddbdd9
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_6D16CFAD_FBF5_45FA_9C7A_78453CA1C505"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The fire inside me still burned white hot."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫내 흥분은 가시질 않았다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_B4D713BB_E59C_4DCF_BA27_FDFA501C1E05
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8ca2ba1edb4aef4405fd37112def583930bfb80609311168a7d914a5cad3d2cc
