msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_3D04F2C2_DD6C_40E1_B514_6F687A1C508C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and it would have had the same effect."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫똑같았을…… 거다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_97CA5CB2_EDFA_4025_8EDC_48C8C39CCE45
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 84c8d6d75a3bc21e2763a742a1b0202db6fc63e20ba06e38f12e884575e9737d
#. default-sha256: eb1b90f825a8b2d1f19f5f551910fae87f12ea60de3e971e58a05de7139a0d38
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_97CA5CB2_EDFA_4025_8EDC_48C8C39CCE45"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫I couldn’t find a sure answer for that question in my somewhat rattled mind either."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 질문에도 ⟪k:1⟫명확한 답이 나오지 않았다.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫그때 나는, ⟪k:4⟫그래…… 적잖이 혼란스러웠"
"다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_980D8750_3935_49AE_968D_713F8567883B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4f70c18cf8b22d02a5d2c6cb101c10c18bd8a428ad8be1fa6f0aefee26c8733b
#. default-sha256: 24ff44246a3a39bf9436866978213604650f91f2fe9d26511203ca507b0985b1
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_980D8750_3935_49AE_968D_713F8567883B"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫but at the time, I had no idea why I didn’t take her life in my frenzy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫그 당시의 나는 ⟪k:1⟫왜 욕망에 따라 그 녀석도 죽이지 않는 건지, ⟪k:2⟫나 자신이 의문스러울 따름"
"이었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_82F9D2D3_251B_4BFE_A601_6423AA02A124
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 792b190aafe001a192f39c135da763dc799354ed672016c5dd8ec1c5ea88c05b
#. default-sha256: 5e47816df2729529c13730a4635afdbc2e79819a5fa1911b61e2caaefaae95e6
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_82F9D2D3_251B_4BFE_A601_6423AA02A124"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Nor did I have any chance of finding decent work.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫So I lived by the sword, killing "
"and plundering."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫당연히 성한 일자리를 얻는 건 불가능했다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫내가 가능한 거라곤 검으로 타인에게서 목숨"
"과 금품을 빼앗는 것뿐."

#: scenario8:scenario8_A40CABFF_30E5_4D4C_A237_E5567586A792
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 735f5ee20276ca2e05a5545b12dcee5db638d945f3783e06e7bdc8248a4bd83e
#. default-sha256: 49310bc0797c0b6136348a597cc912887418c8d1fd0c2b3621fdad57fa9a8dfe
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_A40CABFF_30E5_4D4C_A237_E5567586A792"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The money, I honestly didn’t give a damn about.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫I had no desire to be wealthy."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫솔직히…… 돈은 아무래도 좋았다.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫타인에게서 돈을 빼앗아 부자가 될 생각도 없었다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_21B6BDB5_23FF_4A61_AF9F_B4E3FC08C633
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 04fd0ade7a5706a3f02da7612d0e7659b83a4bf11aa85d08a2b22a13798d567d
#. default-sha256: 1d6cc7bb549a295538f0020ae92dbc8396ad4bff2869de111e1496b232f408ee
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_21B6BDB5_23FF_4A61_AF9F_B4E3FC08C633"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫It was simply a matter of survival—"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫살기 위함과――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_1E1829D0_B81C_4B11_B19E_6D538CF96185
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 30c0cd66c2b2b25a5c8eb259ee0422da5077c93a3df9b620148eeeb196bea89f
#. default-sha256: 13c5adcfa74352ef38412b8b50b2894c2feca1bd41447a6202556f932dbb3c2e
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_1E1829D0_B81C_4B11_B19E_6D538CF96185"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Hell, I couldn’t remember the last time I had bathed."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫이 근방에서 생소한 인종일 뿐더러……⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫목욕도 못 하던 내 육체는 더럽기까지 했거든."

#: scenario8:scenario8_D651E201_9380_45E1_83BB_F1535AAD1D95
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6923162de95dfb898327f4b4629143ce20651752f38188dab552a036a629eedb
#. default-sha256: 846517e58568075acb9b8b532ec3a6df8381118b05b7ab68de2d6ce265483774
msgctxt "scenario8:scenario8_D651E201_9380_45E1_83BB_F1535AAD1D95"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫“This is where I’m going to die,” I thought."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫나는 ⟪k:1⟫죽음을 예감했다."

#: scenario8:scenario8_75E50EEE_CFF9_4963_8736_7322F17853C6
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 58b73ab78276c7ff3b8c9aa9af521e8b319eaa2ed18ef210d87041dd8c03ea2f
