msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Pfft. I don’t need any more damn slaves, and I certainly don’t want ⟪k:2⟫you⟪k:3⟫ as "
"one."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫……뭐? ⟪k:2⟫그런 건 필요 없어. ⟪k:3⟫너를 뭐 하러 내 노예 삼는데.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫하지만――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FC5AE4D6_9F44_4BAC_94E2_8370524322F5
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
