msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Something that’s going to make me a lot of money.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫And if you lend a hand, I’ll "
"make sure you’re well taken care of—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫돈이 될 건수가 있어. ⟪k:2⟫네가 나를 거들겠다면 ⟪k:3⟫편의를 봐주지. ⟪k:4⟫네가 집착하는 교"
"회와――"

#: scenario8:scenario8_FDBA1BE5_AB41_4256_A16A_76FBDDBACD03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d3b564858fcda91b7966902907cbb59f80d157bf3b45b94704535250bfe6d48d
