msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫But saint or not, you can’t simply create food from nothing.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Her “work” is "
"causing financial troubles for the church, is it not?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫하지만 ⟪k:2⟫아무리 성녀라도 무에서 빵을 창조하진 못 해. ⟪k:3⟫그 교회는 운영난 상태야, "
"⟪k:4⟫맞지?"

